	(text_box "Gain:\nPSD: -174 dBm/Hz\nBW: 10 MHz\n\nP_IN = PSD*BW = -104 dBm\nZ_ADC = 200 OHMS DIFF\nVFS_ADC = 2 Vpp = 0.707 VRMS\n\nP_0dBFS = VFS_ADC^2 / Z_ADC = 4 dBm\n\nTarget: Approx ADC SNR down from 0dBFS, with +15 dB extra SNR = 4 dBm - 61dB + 15dB = -42 dB\n\n= require 62 dB of total gain"
